               {"text": "dhūmeneti :– dhūmena sahajena āvriyate vahniḥ prakāśātmakaḥ aprakāśātmakena, yathā vā ādarśaḥ malena ca, yathā ulbena garbhaveṣṭanena jarāyuṇā, āvṛtaḥ ācchāditaḥ, garbhaḥ tathā tena idam āvṛtam.", "tr": "'As fire is covered by smoke…' As fire, which is luminous, is covered by smoke, which is born with it and not luminous; or as a mirror by dust; or as an embryo is covered, enveloped, by the membrane, the womb's caul; so this is covered by that."},
